<h1 class="doc-h1">Select</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A real <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>. There is no <code>SelectTrigger</code>, <code>SelectValue</code> or <code>SelectContent</code> — the native element is all three, and it brings the OS picker on a phone, type-ahead, and a form that posts with no script.
</p>

